Modified Version
----------------
The Vietnamese extension — 134 characters — is a Modified Version of the Font
Software, generated by the `vietfont` tool. It consists of:

    fonts/departure-mono-viet/build/DepartureMonoViet-Regular.otf   release build
    fonts/departure-mono-viet/build/DepartureMono-Viet.otf          hand-built reference build
    fonts/departure-mono-viet/build/DepartureMono-Viet.sfd          FontForge source of the above
    fonts/departure-mono-viet/build/DepartureMonoLigaZ-Regular.otf  ligature variant
    fonts/departure-mono-viet/build/DepartureMonoLigaZ-Regular.ttf  ligature variant
    fonts/departure-mono-viet/marks.json                            mark shapes composed into the builds

All six font binaries above — the two upstream inputs and the four builds —
carry the original copyright notice and this license in their name tables
(nameID 0, 13, 14). A standalone copy of the license sits beside them at
`fonts/departure-mono-viet/OFL.txt`.

The OFL text specifies no Reserved Font Name, so the derivative name
"Departure Mono Viet" is permitted under clause 3.

